[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0507","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0507.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0458","title":"IMP MSWordView /tmp文件权限不当导致本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"IMP/MSWordView 应用程序存在严重的文件权限漏洞。该应用创建的临时文件存储在 /tmp 目录，并设置了世界可读权限，导致任何本地用户均可访问这些临时文件，读取其中存储的敏感信息。这种漏洞源于不安全的文件权限配置，暴露了用户的隐私数据、配置信息和日志记录。攻击者可利用此漏洞读取系统内的敏感信息，可能导致信息泄漏和进一步安全风险。该漏洞影响 IMP/MSWordView 应用的用户及本地系统账户，攻击条件简单，只需获得本地访问权限即可轻易读取临时文件中的敏感数据。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0458"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46Z","remediation":"建议升级 IMP (Internet Messaging Program) 至 2.2 版本或更高版本，该版本已修复 MSWordView 在 /tmp 目录创建全局可读文件的问题。若无法立即升级，可通过设置 /tmp 目录粘滞位 (chmod +t /tmp) 或配置 MSWordView 使用用户私有临时目录 (设置 TMPDIR 环境变量指向 $HOME/tmp 并 chmod 700) 作为临时缓解措施，限制本地用户读取临时文件内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95672120116627&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1360","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0458.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0458","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0458.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0458.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j88w-3rg6-x4gj/GHSA-j88w-3rg6-x4gj.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0458.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0458.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001310.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0507.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0321","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0321.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0320","title":"Qualcomm Qpopper 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Qualcomm Qpopper 2.53 及 3.0 版本 POP3 服务器在处理邮件消息时存在输入验证缺陷。当攻击者发送一条长度恰好为 1023 个字符且以 \\n 结尾的特制邮件消息时，程序内部的 fgets 函数无法正确识别消息结束标识，导致缓存处理异常，进而引发拒绝服务或邮箱数据损坏。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器的 110 端口投递恶意邮件触发该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0320"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:28Z","remediation":"升级 Qpopper 至 3.0.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 fgets 函数对消息行尾 \\n 字符串的错误识别问题。如无法升级，可在 POP3 服务前端部署内容过滤规则，拦截长度超过 1023 字节且以 \\n 结尾的异常邮件行，或限制单封邮件最大行长度以缓解拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1133","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=9763.000421%40SECURITY.NNOV.RU","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0320.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0320","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0320.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0320.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/qpopper_euidl.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5vvr-mcc4-v73q/GHSA-5vvr-mcc4-v73q.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_300_400.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0320.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001309.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0321.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0317","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0317.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0318","title":"Atrium Mercur Mail Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Atrium Mercur Mail Server 3.2 存在路径遍历漏洞，本地攻击者通过在请求中注入 `../` 序列可突破目录限制，越权读取其他用户的电子邮件内容，并在服务器上创建任意文件。该漏洞根因在于软件对用户提交的文件路径参数缺乏充分的合法性校验，攻击者无需高权限即可利用此漏洞窃取敏感邮件数据或破坏系统文件，影响服务器数据机密性与完整性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0318"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27Z","remediation":"升级 Atrium Mercur Mail Server 至 3.2 以上版本以修复路径遍历漏洞；若无法升级，在服务器端严格限制本地用户对邮件存储目录的访问权限，并通过应用程序层对用户输入的文件路径参数进行规范化校验，过滤 \"..\" 等目录穿越字符。同时建议以最小权限原则运行邮件服务进程，避免其拥有过高文件系统写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0057.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1144","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0318.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0318","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0318.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0318.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f4mw-6gjr-pj7w/GHSA-f4mw-6gjr-pj7w.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mercure_imap_read_any_file.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0318.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001308.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f3526cd689b486e2ddce9b934197355bd7bbd3ae/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0317.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0280","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0280.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0336","title":"OpenLDAP OpenLDAP 本地符号链接漏洞","description":"OpenLDAP 1.2.7 至 1.2.10 版本中存在本地符号链接攻击漏洞。当 OpenLDAP 服务在处理临时文件时，不正确地使用了 `/usr/tmp/` 目录，未对临时文件的创建进行安全性检查。拥有本地系统访问权限的攻击者可通过创建恶意的符号链接，将临时文件重定向到任意系统文件，从而实现对目标文件的非授权修改。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，但需要本地用户权限。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，影响 Linux 平台下运行 OpenLDAP 1.2.x 版本的服务器。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0336"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30Z","remediation":"升级 OpenLDAP 至 1.2.11 或更高版本，该版本已修复 `/usr/tmp/` 目录下的符号链接竞争条件。如无法升级，可将临时目录改为仅 root 可写的安全路径（如 `/var/tmp/openldap`），并确保 slapd 以非 root 用户运行，同时使用 `sticky bit` 保护共享临时目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-012.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1232","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2000-May/000009.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19946","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b2989