nable`）以强制要求密码验证。同时限制管理接口的访问 IP 范围（`access-class` 或 ACL）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/catos-enable-bypass-pub.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1288","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1122","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0267.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0267.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0267","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0267.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0267.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mvjh-5wfv-gmqr/GHSA-mvjh-5wfv-gmqr.json","https://github.com/arpitn30/nipper-ng/blob/a344e58392d528c168b74ccda5caa309923fff56/0.11.10/common/report-vulns.c","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0267.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/ee86c26ee0202761283d7d612909ed4cc8981bf7/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0241.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0240","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0240.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0272","title":"RealNetworks RealServer 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealServer 存在输入验证不当漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器的 7070 端口发送特制的畸形数据，触发服务程序崩溃或资源耗尽，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 RealNetworks RealServer Pro 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。官方建议升级至受影响版本的最新补丁或限制对 7070 端口的访问以缓解风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0272"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:22Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 RealServer 8.0 及以上版本（该版本修复了端口 7070 的畸形输入处理问题）。如无法升级，可在防火墙或主机层面限制对 TCP 7070 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接；或直接停用 RealServer 服务并迁移至替代流媒体服务器方案。对于已停止维护的旧版本，强烈建议彻底下线或隔离部署。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95625288231045&w=2","http://service.real.com/help/faq/servg270.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1128","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19856","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0272.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0272","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0272.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0272.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vj56-ggxg-589r/GHSA-vj56-ggxg-589r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realserver_ussr_dos.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0272.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f5f5c41f-d5e3-426c-bd28-e78b1ae244a5.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0240.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0800","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0800.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0256","title":"Microsoft FrontPage 97/98 Server Extensions 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft FrontPage 97/98 服务器扩展中的 htimage.exe 和 Imagemap.exe 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该溢出，导致服务器执行任意代码或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 FrontPage 97/98 Server Extensions，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0256"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:20Z","remediation":"立即删除受影响服务器上所有 Htimage.exe 和 Imagemap.exe 文件，这些文件通常位于 FrontPage Server Extensions 安装目录下（如 `%ProgramFiles%\\Common Files\\Microsoft Shared\\Web Server Extensions`）。对于使用 Windows NT 4.0 Option Pack 或 Personal Web Server 4.0 的系统，同样需搜索并移除这两个组件。ISP 应同时在 FrontPage Server Extensions 管理界面中限制用户上传时重新引入这两个文件。长期建议升级至 FrontPage 2000 Server Extensions 或更高版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/470458/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1117","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-028","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/34720","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19853","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0256.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0256","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0256.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0256.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/fp_htimage.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf