溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在服务器上停止 webadmin.nlm 和 webhttp.nlm 服务，或在网络边界防火墙阻断对 8008/TCP 和 8009/TCP 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1118","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0004171825340.10088-100000%40nimue.tpi.pl","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19854","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0257.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0257","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0257.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0257.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w36g-w35g-jmxf/GHSA-w36g-w35g-jmxf.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0257.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0231.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0231.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0250","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0250.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0271","title":"GNU Emacs 密码历史记录未清除本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"GNU Emacs 20 版本的 `read-passwd` 等 Lisp 函数在处理密码输入后未能正确清除最近按键历史记录，导致本地攻击者可通过读取按键历史缓冲区获取未加密的明文密码。该漏洞影响 GNU Emacs 20 系列版本，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。建议升级至 Emacs 21 或更高版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0271"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:22Z","remediation":"升级到 GNU Emacs 21 及以上版本，该版本已修复 read-passwd 函数未清除历史按键缓冲区的问题。如无法升级，可在输入密码后手动执行 (clear-this-command-keys) 清除按键历史，或避免在多用户共享系统上使用 Emacs 的密码输入功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1125","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-04-15&msg=tg4s8zioxq.fsf%40mercury.rus.uni-stuttgart.de","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0271.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0271","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0271.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0271.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7mr4-hhph-pp56/GHSA-7mr4-hhph-pp56.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0271.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fe2ed06b-8f42-45aa-8a37-c96c4301eb76.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/eebf829d86861484c6ea731ef53f87c686c4f91c/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0250.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0248","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0248.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0270","title":"GNU Emacs 可预测临时文件名本地符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"GNU Emacs 20 中的 make-temp-name Lisp 函数在创建临时文件时使用可预测的文件名，本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击（symlink attack）在目标系统上实现文件劫持或信息窃听。该漏洞影响 GNU Emacs 20 及可能受影响的早期版本，攻击者需拥有本地用户权限，利用难度较低。建议升级至不受影响的版本或采用安全的临时文件创建方式。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0270"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:22Z","remediation":"升级到 Emacs 21.1 或更高版本（2001 年 10 月发布），该版本引入 make-temp-file 函数，该函数原子化创建临时文件，从根本上消除竞争条件。如无法升级，将所有 Elisp 代码中对 make-temp-name 的调用替换为 make-temp-file，并确保创建临时文件时使用 O_CREAT|O_EXCL 标志防止符号链接劫持。作为临时缓解措施，在系统层面配置 umask 077 避免其他用户访问临时目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1126","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-04-15&msg=tg4s8zioxq.fsf%40mercury.rus.uni-stuttgart.de","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0270.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0270","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0270.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0270.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-83rm-6fqr-j4q7/GHSA-83rm-6fqr-j4q7.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/